290	    // Changesets writes a bare `## <version>` heading, and step 6 of
291	    // `scripts/verify-release-identity.mjs` requires exactly that form before a
292	    // release may be tagged. This assertion previously required the
293	    // hand-written Keep-a-Changelog form `## [<version>]`, which meant the two
